<!doctype html><html lang="it"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>Regole, razze e abilità</title><script src="/js/ui-dialog.js" defer></script><script src="/js/rpg-admin.js?v=<?=filemtime(dirname(__DIR__,2).'/js/rpg-admin.js')?>" defer></script></head><body class="ui-page"><main class="rpg-admin" data-rpg-admin>
<header class="ui-page-heading" data-page-heading><span data-icon="swords" aria-hidden="true"></span><div><div class="ui-eyebrow">Alphano · Amministrazione</div><h1>Regole, razze e abilità</h1><p>Un solo catalogo per profili, PNG e risoluzione del combattimento.</p></div></header>
